			"fileName": "page.tsx",
			"wiki": "The user navigates to the ML Settings page and selects 'Large Language Model (Zero-shot Learning)' from the NLU Pipeline Type dropdown. This action updates the local state of the component, causing the UI to render the LLM-specific configuration fields.",
			"cellName": "Configuration Flow: Select LLM Pipeline - page.tsx:L74-82",
			"cellId": "d5279dbc-8093-4e94-8d32-0c67a1219d13",
