					"simStepLabel": "Backend Receives Training Request",
					"simStepDescription": "The FastAPI backend receives the request at the `/train/build_models` endpoint. To avoid blocking the server, it schedules the `build_models_background` function to run as a background task and immediately returns a confirmation response.",
