					"simStepLabel": "Train Entity Extractor Model",
					"simStepDescription": "The `CRFEntityExtractor` converts the annotated examples into a format suitable for CRF training, creating features and BIO (Beginning, Inside, Outside) labels for each token. It then trains a Conditional Random Fields model using `pycrfsuite` and saves the resulting model to `crf_entity_extractor.model`.",
