					"simStepLabel": "Reload Dialogue Manager with New Models",
					"simStepDescription": "The `reload_dialogue_manager` function is called, which in turn calls the `update_model` method on the active `DialogueManager` instance. This method instructs the NLU pipeline to load the newly created model files from the disk, making them immediately available for processing user input.",
