			"description": "<ul><li>This use case focuses on making the created chatbot accessible to end-users on various platforms</li><li>- <strong>Channel Configuration</strong>: The admin UI (<code>/frontend/app/admin/settings/integrations/page</li><li>tsx</code>) allows users to enable and configure different communication channels</li><li>- <strong>Web Chat Widget</strong>: For websites, the system provides a JavaScript snippet (<code>ChatWidget</li><li>tsx</code>) that can be embedded into any HTML page to deploy the chat interface</li><li>- <strong>Facebook Messenger</strong>: The framework includes a dedicated webhook (<code>/app/bot/channels/facebook/routes</li><li>py</code>) to integrate directly with a Facebook Page, allowing users to interact via Messenger</li><li>- <strong>REST API</strong>: A generic REST endpoint (<code>/app/bot/channels/rest/routes</li><li>py</code>) is available for custom integrations</li></ul>",
