				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>The framework supports complex, multi-step interactions by maintaining conversational context and state for each user</li><li>- <strong>State Management</strong>: The <code>DialogueManager</code> tracks the conversation state, including the active intent, collected parameters, and missing parameters</li><li>- <strong>Parameter Slot-Filling</strong>: If a user's request is missing required information, the bot will intelligently prompt for it based on the intent's parameter configuration</li><li>- <strong>Persistent Memory</strong>: Conversation state is persisted for each user (identified by a <code>thread_id</code>) in a MongoDB collection using the <code>MemorySaverMongo</code> class, ensuring context is not lost between messages</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
				"f4ea6092-c89b-434b-9e7a-dfd47102c5dc": {
