			"description": "<ul><li>An essential part of the development lifecycle, this feature provides an interactive environment to test the chatbot and inspect its behavior</li><li>- <strong>Chat Interface</strong>: The admin panel includes a real-time chat UI (<code>/frontend/app/admin/chat/page</li><li>tsx</code>) for sending messages to the bot</li><li>- <strong>State Inspection</strong>: Alongside the conversation, a debug panel displays the full JSON <code>ChatState</code> object after each turn</li><li>- <strong>Debugging Aid</strong>: This allows developers to see exactly how the NLU pipeline processed the message, which intent was identified, what entities were extracted, and what parameters are still missing, greatly simplifying the debugging process</li></ul>",
