			"description": "<ul><li>This feature provides visibility into chatbot-user interactions, which is crucial for analytics, quality assurance, and continuous improvement</li><li>- <strong>Conversation History</strong>: The platform automatically logs all conversations</li><li>- <strong>Admin UI</strong>: A dedicated 'Chat Logs' page (<code>/frontend/app/admin/chatlogs/page</li><li>tsx</code>) in the admin panel lists all conversation threads</li><li>- <strong>Detailed View</strong>: Users can select any thread to view the complete back-and-forth exchange between the user and the bot</li><li>- <strong>Data for Improvement</strong>: These logs are invaluable for understanding how users interact with the bot and identifying areas for improvement in NLU training or conversational flow design</li></ul>",
