					"simStepLabel": "Runtime Flow: Initialize LLM Client",
					"simStepDescription": "The constructor of `ZeroShotNLUOpenAI` receives the LLM settings. It uses these settings to initialize a `ChatOpenAI` client from the LangChain library, which will handle communication with the LLM API.",
					"isEdge": 1,
