				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>This advanced feature allows developers to leverage Large Language Models (LLMs) for NLU, reducing the need for extensive manual training</li><li>- <strong>LLM-based NLU</strong>: The NLU pipeline can be configured with the <code>ZeroShotNLUOpenAI</code> component, which uses an OpenAI-compatible API to perform intent recognition and entity extraction</li><li>- <strong>No Training Data Needed</strong>: Instead of labeled sentences, it relies on a carefully crafted prompt that instructs the LLM on what intents and entities to look for</li><li>- <strong>Faster Prototyping</strong>: This significantly speeds up the development process, as new intents can be added and tested without a lengthy data collection and training cycle</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
				"d5279dbc-8093-4e94-8d32-0c67a1219d13": {
