					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 (Docker Compose): Create and Start Containers",
					"simStepDescription": "Using the defined images (pulled or locally built), Docker creates and starts the containers for all services (`mongodb`, `app`, `frontend`), applying volume mounts and port mappings.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
