					"simStepLabel": "Flow 2 (Kubernetes/Helm): Initiate Production Deployment",
					"simStepDescription": "An operator initiates the deployment to a Kubernetes cluster by running the `helm upgrade` command. This command installs or upgrades the application release defined by the 'ai-chatbot-framework' Helm chart.",
