					"simStepLabel": "Flow 2 (Kubernetes/Helm): Create Kubernetes Resources",
					"simStepDescription": "The Kubernetes control plane acts on the manifests, creating a Deployment resource for the backend. The Deployment controller then creates a ReplicaSet, which in turn creates the Pods.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
