					"simStepLabel": "Flow 2 (Kubernetes/Helm): Start Backend Container",
					"simStepDescription": "Once the image is pulled, the Kubelet starts the container inside the pod, injecting the configured environment variables such as the MongoDB connection URL.",
					"isEdge": 0,
