			"description": "<ul><li>A key value proposition of the framework is the ability to be fully self-hosted, giving organizations complete control over their data and infrastructure</li><li>- <strong>Containerization</strong>: The entire application stack (Python backend, Next</li><li>js frontend, MongoDB) is containerized using Docker</li><li>- <strong>Easy Setup</strong>: <code>docker-compose</li><li>yml</code> files are provided for a straightforward setup on a single machine for development or small-scale production</li><li>- <strong>Kubernetes Deployment</strong>: For scalable, production-grade deployments, a Helm chart (<code>/helm/ai-chatbot-framework</code>) is available to deploy the framework to a Kubernetes cluster</li></ul>",
