			"description": "<ul><li>This provides a mechanism for backing up, migrating, and sharing bot configurations</li><li>- <strong>Export Functionality</strong>: The system allows exporting all of a bot's data—including intents, entities, and training examples—into a single JSON file via an API endpoint (<code>/admin/bots/{name}/export</code>)</li><li>- <strong>Import Functionality</strong>: This JSON file can be imported into another instance of the application to replicate the bot's configuration</li><li>- <strong>Use Cases</strong>: This is useful for migrating bots between environments (e</li><li>g</li><li>, dev to prod), creating backups, or sharing pre-built bot templates, as shown with the <code>order_status</li><li>json</code> example file</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
				"f66e9a07-fc8d-4c4d-a040-bacb504cd1de": {
